    {
      "id": "good_luck",
      "title": "Hold the Funnel",
      "body": "Survive all 10 waves to win. Next steps: build a Laboratory and press T to research Electricity, then mine the copper halfway up the arms. Later waves bring Brutes, acid-spitting Spitters and Sappers that blow up belts and power. The silver claim zone behind the choke mines twice as fast.\n\nGood luck, Engineer.",
      "focus": { "x": 40.5, "y": 58 }, "zoom": 1.0
    }
